OL,3,GNEWSARaids target heroin and crack
OL,4,Acocaine supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix men have been arrested in drugs
OL,7,Fraids which aimed to target the supply
OL,8,Fof heroin and crack cocaine in Salford.
OL,10,FAbout 50 police officers were involved
OL,11,Fin the operation, which took place at
OL,12,Ffive addresses in the Pendlebury and
OL,13,FClifton areas of the city at 0530 BST.
OL,15,FOfficers seized drugs which are
OL,16,Fbelieved to be cocaine and heroin, cash
OL,17,Fand two high-value mountain bikes,
OL,18,Fwhich are suspected to have been
OL,19,Fstolen.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
