OL,3,GNEWSARaids target heroin and crack
OL,4,Acocaine supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Lee Gridley said the raids were
OL,7,Fthe "result of months of evidence
OL,8,Fgathering" by Swinton's neighbourhood
OL,9,Fteams to "take action against people
OL,10,Fwho prey on the vulnerable".
